# SHAFAF HISAB — Environment Configuration
# Manage Better. Grow Smarter.

# SHAFAF HISAB frontend runs completely self-contained out-of-the-box.
# No backend keys are strictly required for standard operations, local testing, or exported preview.
# All data isolation, customer khata, invoices, sales, and analytics run local-first.

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Optional for Gemini AI Smart Insights features.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets if enabled.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# APP_URL: Optional base URL where this applet is hosted (e.g. http://localhost:3000)
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"
